        "additionalProperties": false,
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Visual",
        "description": "Data for a native slide object.\n\nValidation rejects only what cannot be rendered. Density limits from the brief\n(table size, series count, missing units) are quality findings, so they are\nraised by the audit where the user can see and decide on them."
      }
